00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:13.330
Yeah. I feel like that's totally not, like I can't think of an immediate example of a split screen.

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:16.250
And I can't think of any way to play this game not split screen.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.650
If you're not, right. Well, I think.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:22.490
I haven't really considered that. I think that they're kind of, what, what kind of redeems them from not having a multiplayer

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:25.550
is what my favorite part is, is the create your course thing.

