00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.030
really cool. Yeah. Do like a huge patch of grass too though.

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:20.550
So you gotta make sure you nail that jump.

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:25.730
Yeah. Uh, yeah, I really liked this design mode and it's just like, it's, it's unexpected.

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.450
