00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:11.530
can think of in that, that, that they could have made in the game.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:16.530
And it gives you an appreciation for like kind of the game design of it because like, yeah.

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:20.570
And like what Sam was saying, you can make it like really, you can make it like difficult

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:23.670
in a bad way in like a, in like a dumb way.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:27.070
But then it makes you think like, oh, how do you, how do I kind of fix this and make

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.130
it like kind of cool? And then there's like all these cool ideas.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:32.010
Like I didn't even think of putting like all those blue strips together.

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:34.050
Like that's kind of a cool mechanic that.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.330
A Mario maker way.

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:39.430
