00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:14.310
Patch of grass. And, and I think like after that, I, I, I went right to kind of like the, um, what

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.410
are those like the dirt patches?

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:20.490
Yeah. You know, I kind of went for that as like crisscrosses and really just tried to make a course

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:24.450
that like, you really had to just like, you know, be perfect with your timing of like

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.770
zigzagging. That means that we each have like our own little like personality in the course.

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:30.590
Right. Which I think is neat. And if, yeah, it feels fun.

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:36.210
And I think like, you know, even if you were a kid, when you came out and you were tasked

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:43.010
